WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Mkataba kwa dakika chache

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:09.001
Chagua aina ya muamala: huduma, mauzo, kukodisha au mkopo.

00:00:09.001 --> 00:00:11.601
Hatua na upokeaji kwa orodha ya ukaguzi

00:00:11.601 --> 00:00:18.002
Gawa muamala katika hatua, kila moja na orodha ya kinachopaswa kufanyika.

00:00:18.002 --> 00:00:20.602
Malipo yanayofungamana na matokeo

00:00:20.602 --> 00:00:27.005
Malipo hufuata hatua: iliyopokelewa inalipwa.

00:00:27.005 --> 00:00:29.605
Ushahidi unaodumu

00:00:29.605 --> 00:00:36.007
Picha, faili na ujumbe hufungwa kwenye hatua na kupigwa muhuri wa muda unaoaminika.

00:00:36.007 --> 00:00:45.009
Sifa iliyojengwa juu ya ukweli

